ter details please check last request.\n\nI have two ideas and you can pick the one you prefer: \n\nA:\n[Risotto Nero] and [Cappuccino] are having a date in the streets of Italy. A romantic interaction between them. For example they are seeking shelter from the weather or they enjoy a fancy dinner together. \n\nB:\nThey are resting at the hitman team base at the couch (there are pictures how the base looks in the reference folder) and [Cappuccino] is sitting between his legs or on his lap. They are having an intimate romantic moment.\n\nI would be happy if you could keep their very large height difference in mind. I would appreciate if you draw both of their faces so that you can see both of their eyes. Eyes also opened.\n\nI always enjoy moody and dynamic looking, story telling art. \n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-A7BYIsRbqNhiC5wwOY5Vr7aJ__JFEfQ", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@naspibon_ox/works/26", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2693085, "client_id": 3659550, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=085075b5fcd932caf6716f3faa35fbf3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=085075b5fcd932caf6716f3faa35fbf3, https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbe3d3daa8c45a69095014f832749cb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0ece07017b7454a001a9006f87b52c54 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=299711add843fa3b252a427d0a9043d6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=299711add843fa3b252a427d0a9043d6, https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ea580641444a1fc14816a78fdd56d0e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f9b018ca/uploads/origins/a38e74b2-c9f7-4840-a977-b67e1d5fd4ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=43e119a513dad875377f463554997f5a 3x"}, "body": "Hello,\n\nSav again. Your last illustration was so wonderful. The more it was so great, the more I wanted to lee quest again.\n\nRecently I was into an anime called Banana Fish.\n\nCould you please draw an illustration of Eiji and Ash in your own way?\n\nBackground: A rural Japanese place. I like winter, spring and autumn scenery. My favorite places are Shonan, Chichibu, Yamaguchi, Oita, Yamagata, and Hokkaido. Eiji is from Izumo City in Shimane Prefecture, so I would like the scenery of Izumo City or a rural area.\n\nAsh would like to see Eiji and I living together in Japan, so that's why I made this request.\n\nPose: I would like to see them doing seasonal activities or relaxing somewhere (house, park, amusement park, etc.)\n\nAlso, can you please make the illustration in 9x16 size? We will use it for our Kobo screen saver.\n\nThank you very much.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@naspibon_ox/works/25", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "cr