なすぼんさんの描きスタイルがとても素敵だと思います。\n\nNetflixの「Arcane」のCaitlynとViのイラストを自分なりに描いていただけませんか？\n\n背景：日本の田舎っぽいなところ。冬、春と秋の景色がいいです。一番好きなところは湘南、秩父、山口、大分、山形、北海道\n\nポーズ：季節の活動をしているか、どこかでのんびりする形などがいい　（家、公園、遊園地など）\n\nまた、イラストのサイズは9x16でお願いできますか？ Koboスクリーンセーバーに使わせていただきます。\n\nポーズ：季節の活動をしているか、どこかでのんびりする形などがいい　（家、公園、遊園地など）\n\nまた、イラストのサイズは9x16でお願いできますか？ Koboスクリーンセーバーに使わせていただきます。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@naspibon_ox/works/22", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2693085, "client_id": 3512411, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5722492f740fe91a4f4452d326327671", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5722492f740fe91a4f4452d326327671, https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=527bebd7668ba9773da7f15e812bdf58 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1600312fa021171803c8cfe63ccff38b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90fcd785f78a6b0bee33b3e01a060178", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=90fcd785f78a6b0bee33b3e01a060178, https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=80ddcfe717985c03720736766eff693b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53fb6510/uploads/origins/4a954704-ba97-4961-a5ec-9d064e068653?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93eb97d98c2bb4898b039e36bc9c4a4c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your artwork. \nI was hoping to get a piece with two of my original characters.\nThey're knights from enemy kingdoms who are trapped in the woods together. At first, they are constantly trying to get each other, but have to learn to get along to survive over time. Whether you'd like to draw them as enemies or as companions is up to you!\n\nHere are photos of them: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E5jFT8UIUsaqHt6wJehJX3OAgMaAR6bj?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E5jFT8UIUsaqHt6wJehJX3OAgMaAR6bj?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@naspibon_ox/works/21", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2693085, "client_id": 3407452, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b83fcf8e249b9d3e398e7189bc5c88a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b83fcf8e249b9d3e398e7189bc5c88a, https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c15d6db4b54f1a4a750aee4f4e08cd36 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65d2c548143cdd6b597aeea8a7449473 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=979fce72c95704d8610d6f72e5576bf5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=979fce72c95704d8610d6f72e5576bf5, https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e226b8603b9daaba918f36a099ce1559 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e7c8fe0a/uploads/origins/6bfb5597-18bb-4389-b202-ee000f7c7ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9a15b3132972d0191b7f74cb71676a67 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really enjoy your art!\n\nI would love to request you with a drawing of my OC and a character from Jojo Part 5. My OC is called [Cappuccino|カプチーノ]. The male character is called [Risotto Nero|リゾット]. They are in a romantic relationship and assassins. \n\n[カプチーノ]: \n29 years old. 166cm tall with shoes. She is an adult, mature woman with a feminine and muscular build. Quiet and calm personality wise. She is usually more outgoing and lighthearted in private.\n\n[リゾット]: \n28 years old. 195cm tall with a very muscular build. Very serious and stoic. A very intimidating, analytical and smart person. With [カプチーノ] he is more relaxed , attentive and very protective and gentle with her.   \n\nFor this commission I would love them being outside in the streets of Italy at night.The atmosphere could be dark and mysterious. It could them having just done an assassination or just enjoying the night together. It can also rain!\nI leave the composition up to you! \n\nThank you very much for your consideration\n\nhttps://dri