ing to an institution that houses alien species, and has no gender. The main body is housed in the skin of a doll made by a researcher. Characteristics include white skin, elf-like ears, and slightly transparent blue tentacles (on the main body).\n\nThe desired composition is that the character's skin is inside the culture tank, and we will leave the details and parts that are not visible to you.\nYou may also arrange the costume and hair style, and we would be happy to draw it as you wish.\n\nIf you accept this request, I would sincerely appreciate it.\n\nPlease find attached below the character's material:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JjYR8LxAVzlDVMpmtd99Y28doBb_6YIL?usp=sharing\n\nThank you very much in advance.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 852565, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぐじゃ太🍼", "screen_name": "NrU6c", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1611751118153093120/vq6gsoGB.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/775633948697202688/1680187723/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 1439944, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "いの", "screen_name": "ino12285", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1515629754468106242/UDp0tNFT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1357736769601478656/1666558460/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genr