 over the years but it's also made her a more prideful. While she takes work seriously, there's nothing more she loves more than to spend time with her boyfriend, Hau.\n\nHau is 22. Despite being an adult he's still carefree and takes nothing to seriously. He's taken over his Grandpa's position and wears his robe over his own favorite T-shirt. The only thing he loves more than his Friends and Malasadas is his girlfriend, Lillie.\n\nHau is slightly muscular and has defined abs but is still skinny. Lillie ponytail is very long and she has a curvy body. She's only slightly shorter than Hau. \n\nI want an illustration of them on a casual date with the setting of your choosing. They could be walking down together on a city block or eating at a restaurant or watching a movie on the couch. Whichever you choose. Thank you!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@naspibon_ox/works/24", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2693085, "client_id": 2060511, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/71928a69/uploads/origins/94b310b0-4367-4963-9297-74c99f4e38c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b53a360ecfd450f83e1e4e93ed319e1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/71928a69/uploads/origins/94b310b0-4367-4963-9297-74c99f4e38c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b53a360ecfd450f83e1e4e93ed319e1, https://si.imgix.net/71928a69/uploads/origins/94b310b0-4367-4963-9297-74c99f4e38c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a1c2511e776316dc55e926311edc4a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/71928a69/uploads/origins/94b310b0-4367-4963-9297-74c99f4e38c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c1709fef59ad267ea65c04fc204b6202 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail